<title>PORTUGAL: Portucel, Ence form sales venture.</title>
<headline>Portucel, Ence form sales venture.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portuguese pulp concern Portucel Industrial said it had signed an accord with Spain's Ence to form an equally-owned joint venture to sell eucalyptus pulp outside Europe.</p>
<p>The joint venture would be aimed at developing sales in the Far East and North America where the companies had never had a regular sales presence.</p>
</text>
